  "title": "Batched High-Order mTHP Swap-in for Zswap",
  "headline": "Screening benchmark: assembling contiguous compressed zswap slots into high-order folios yields -4.7% sequential and -5.8% p99 latency reduction on zswap, but geomean effect (-2.3%) remains within the calibrated noise floor.",
